<title>AUSTRALIA: Woodroffe recommends Hills bid.</title>
<headline>Woodroffe recommends Hills bid.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woodroffe Industries Ltd said on Thursday that its independent directors recommended that shareholders accept the revised 82 cent per share takeover bid by Hills Industries Ltd.  </p>
<p>Hills, an Adelaide-based industrial products group, said earlier it had increased its offer by seven cents per share and would extend the closing date to April 22.</p>
<p>Hills is entitled to a little more than 50 percent of Woodroffe.</p>
<p>The latest bid values the target firm at A$12.72 million, based on 15.51 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
